  "description": "On a bold and potentially dangerous mission to revive the classic Arcade military shooter. Fully loaded with addictive top-down and side-scrolling run-and-gun gameplay, pixel-perfect 2D graphics, explosive SID soundtrack and massive destruction! Fight on foot and in heavily armed vehicles.\n\nDo you miss the days of the Arcade military shooter? Single-handedly blasting your way through entire armies of enemy soldiers, rescuing good guys, and blowing lots of stuff up!!\n\nRelying on just your reactions, your fast trigger finger and a limited grenade supply. Do you pine for the classics of the genre games?\n\nIf the answer is yes, Machine Gun Fury is here!",
